{{Card Infobox|Cost=2|Rarity=Common|Type=Troop|Arena=Jungle Arena|ReleaseDate=3 February 2025}}

{{Quote|It's surprising how often she needs her axes sharpened, but then again, if you liked hitting things as fast as her, so would you.}}
The Berserker is a [[:Category:Common Cards|Common]] [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Jungle Arena (Arena 9)]] It spawns a fast, single-target, ground-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with moderate hitpoints and low damage. She appears as a kid who wears a brown dress made of bear skin and wristbands and a team-colored belt, has orange hair with two buns, eyes and eyebrows, a loose tooth, and a scar on her left chin, arms and legs, and wields a pair of cleavers. A Berserker card costs 2 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

==Modifiers==
===[[File:Berserker Common Modifier.png|45x45px]] Common: Beatdown Boulevard===
{{Quote|+200% hit speed}}
Berserker's attack speed is increased by 200%, for a total of 0.2 seconds.

===[[File:Berserker Rare Modifier.png|45x45px]] Rare: Don't Get in Her Way===
{{Quote|Charge attack}}
Berserker's charges an attack similarly to a [[Bandit]].

===[[File:Berserker Epic Modifier.png|45x45px]] Epic: Mutilation Meditation===
{{Quote|Heal on attack}}
Berserker heals herself when she attacks.

==Strategy==
{{Battle Deck with Card|:Category:Battle Decks using the Berserker Card}}
*The Berserker is a great option to use against enemy [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] such as small swarms and medium size units as she has a moderate amount of hitpoints and high hit speed but low damage, and is perfect for attacks with other tanks.
*The Berserker pairs really well with [[Rune Giant]] as her fast attack speed and average hitpoints makes her get a lot of bonus damage.
**She also kills a lot of swarms that surrounds the Rune Giant, and can also do good damage against bigger troops as well.
*With the help of a [[Tower Princess]], she's an excellent option against weak ground swarms on defense thanks to her fast attack rate and low cost.
*A Berserker can fully counter an unsupported [[Goblin Drill]] for a +2 Elixir trade. Place her in such a way that she tanks the first spawned Goblin and then tanks the death spawn Goblins.
*On defense, a Berserker paired with an [[Ice Spirit]] forms an extremely potent defensive combo that only costs 3 [[Elixir]]. The Ice Spirit can distract a target and/or freeze it, allowing the Berserker to land 3-5 more hits.

