==History==
2025
*The Berserker [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/2/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/2/2025)|February 2025 Update]].
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], fixed an issue with Berserker's [[Star Points|Star Level]] sound effects.
*On 11/2/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (11/2/2025)|maintenance break]], decreased the Berserker's attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.6 seconds).
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Berserker's hitpoints by 8%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]] increased Berserker's Hit Speed to 0.6 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).

