==Trivia==
*The word "''Berserker''" comes from the Old Norse "''berserkr''", meaning 'warrior clothed in bearskin'.
*In the Turkish language settings of the game, the Berserker's name translates to "Naughty".
*The [[Cards|card]] image shows 2 [[Fire Spirit|Fire Spirits]], one behind the Berserker's cheek, and another Berserker on the background.
*The Berserker is 1 of 7 troops to have a death voiceline/death scream, the others being the [[Battle Healer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Mighty Miner]], and [[Monk]].
*If a [[Rune Giant]] throws her enhancement at a Berserker, the Berserker will perform her enhanced attack with both weapons at once instead of only one of them. This is merely a visual indicator; her attack does not hit twice or deal double damage.
*The Berserker is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*Before the Berserker's card release, the Berserker's damage was increased by 25% and her attack time interval was increased to 0.6 seconds (from 0.5 seconds). 
*In the [[TV Royale|TV royale]] released on the 27th of July 2026 it was confirmed that [https://www.youtube.com/@kenforrest Ken] is the berserker's official father and the [[Rune Giant]] is the official mother.

